    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 184 - 228 (Roll no. 125).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "17:19:11",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2665-2667)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "15:53:55",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on the motion to recommit with instructions, the Chair put the question on the motion and by voice vote, announced that the noes had prevailed. Mr. Riggleman demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further consideration on the motion to recommit until a time to be announced.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "15:53:49",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "15:49:06",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Riggleman motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment to strike section 3 from the bill and insert a new section prohibiting the use of social security numbers.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "15:48:23",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Financial Services Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsba00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsba00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Riggleman moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on Financial Services. (text: CR H2663)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-29",
   "actionTime": "15:47:52",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2663-2664)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-26",
   "actionTime": "16:14:49",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of Rule XIX, further proceedings on H.R. 5332 were postponed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-26",
   "actionTime": "16:14:02",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-26",
   "actionTime": "15:22:53",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 5332.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-26",
   "actionTime": "15:19:32",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1425, H.R. 5332, H.R. 7120, H.R. 7301 and H.J. Res. 90. The resolution provides that the provisions of section 125(c) of the Uruguay Round Agreements Act shall not apply during the remainder of the 116th Congress and the resolution amends H.Res. 967, agreed to on May 15, 2020.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-26",
   "actionTime": "15:19:27",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1017. (consideration: CR H2559-2571)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2020-06-24",
   "actionTime": "19:02:39",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1017 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1425, H.R. 5332, H.R. 7120, H.R. 7301 and H.J. Res. 90. The resolution provides that the provisions of section 125(c) of the Uruguay Round Agreements Act shall not apply during the remainder of the 116th Congress and the resolution amends H.Res. 967, agreed to on May 15, 2020.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
